diff --git a/winit/src/changelog/unreleased.md b/winit/src/changelog/unreleased.md
index 7bd0d705..9a3dbc59 100644
--- a/winit/src/changelog/unreleased.md
+++ b/winit/src/changelog/unreleased.md
@@ -40,6 +40,13 @@ changelog entry.
 
 ## Unreleased
 
+### Added
+
+- On macOS, honour `ImeRequestData::with_surrounding_text`: the text input client answers
+  `selectedRange` and `attributedSubstringForProposedRange:actualRange:` from it, and a
+  `replacementRange` it resolves is reported as `Ime::DeleteSurrounding` before the commit or
+  preedit that replaces it.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - On Windows, fix a crash occurring when trying to create a DXGI surface on a window that is both fullscreen and always on top.
@@ -50,6 +57,10 @@ changelog entry.
 - On Wayland, fix the text input being destroyed whenever a seat capability changed. This made IME input stop working in already-running applications after the seat's capabilities were updated.
 - On Wayland, fix a panic when a popup is dropped before its queued compositor
   updates are processed.
+- On macOS, fix the press-and-hold accent menu never opening, and the key that picks from it being
+  typed as well, for an application that reports surrounding text.
+- On macOS, fix text inserted with no keystroke behind it (the Emoji & Symbols picker, dictation,
+  services) being dropped; it is now reported as `Ime::Commit`.
 
 ### Changed
 
